  "title": "OB-Xd",
  "provider": "parameter-bank",
  "bank_format": "obxd-legacy",
  "quirks": [
    "77 normalized LV2 controls; legacy program files use engine indices, not LV2 port numbers.",
    "Patch snapshots are saved in the project; source banks are not required for playback.",
    "Host bank selection does not recreate the synth instance."
